            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Khub. 18.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Buli kumwiiko, ra alubeka sitonyi silala khwikhumi sie bibiaamo bie kumukuunda kwenywe bioosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cha abuundu alala ao niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe aarobora abe ekhusaayilao. Abwenao ebweeni wewe lia sitonyi silala khwikhumi sie biakhulia bienywe, endali ne kamafura nende ekhaafu embele ne likheese libele. Khola lino nio mweyike khuuria Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe buli lwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abuundu e khusaayilao anyala aaba aleeyi lukali. Khwako se munyala mwasuta mwayilayo sitonyi silala khwikhumi sie bibiaamo nibio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, amubiitile chikhabi mala mwanyoola tawe. Kaaba kario, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusia bibiaamo bienywe mala mubukule chirupia muche nacho abuundu niio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi arobore e khusaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chirumikhire khukula sisiindu siosi siosi nisio mwenya khulia, kula enyama ye khaafu, eye likheese, endali ne kamalwa. Biliile ebweeneyo, ebweeni wa Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe, enywe nende be chinju chenywe mulalia mala mwekhoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mukhalekelesia Balawi bamenyile mu ngoba chenywe tawe. Se bali ne sitonyi namwe kumukabwa kwabwe tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mwiiko kukhola khataru ne kwolile khu siakamo siakwo, mureere sitonyi silala khwikhumi sie bibiaamo bienywe bioosi mala mubibuunge mu ngoba chenywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sino sili siakhulia sie Balawi sikila se bali ne kumukabwa kwabwe tawe, lundi sili sie bakeni, bafuubi ne banamulekhwa bamenyile mu ngoba chenywe. Baleecha mala banyoole nibio benya bioosi. Khola lino mala Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele wenywe naye amubiite enywe chikhabi mu buli siindu nisio mukhola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
